Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 150

{
  "detail": "Batch Entity Upsert: input array is empty",
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



15. null element → 400
======================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 154

{
  "detail": "Batch Entity Upsert: null entry at position 1",
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



